fixture z1_07_control_late_dash
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 7; control for z1_07_coyote_dash: the first dash pressed on the eighth airborne frame, after coyote time, is the air dash
room zone1/07_coyote_dash
spawn 74 864
frames 170
input
  0..57 R
  58 R dash
  59..100 R
  # Frame 101 is the eighth airborne frame (Ash walked off on 94): the coyote time (6 frames) is
  # over, so this dash is the air dash. There is no second one and the air jump alone falls short.
  101 R dash
  102..125 R
  126..169 R jump
end
expect
  at 101 event.dash=1 state=dash air_frames=7 air_dashes=0
  mark pit 102..169 event.hazard=1
  never 0..169 event.room=1
end
